\newlabel{fig:eda-pairwise-confusion}{{4.2}{46}{Pairwise generator preference matrix ordered by overall ranking. Each cell is the score rate for the row generator against the column generator, with ties counted as 0.5. Green indicates a higher score rate for the row generator}{figure.caption.22}{}}
